{
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.wolf/hooks/session-start.js\"",
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "echo 'Nudge (superpowers): brainstorming for design, writing-plans for multi-step work, test-driven-development for features/bugs, systematic-debugging for bugs, requesting-code-review after edits, verification-before-completion before claiming done. All optional — skip if not installed.'"
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "HOOK_NUDGE_MESSAGE=\"CAVEMAN WENYAN-ULTRA ENFORCE: main agent thinking = wenyan-ultra (max-compression classical Chinese). Main agent to owner = caveman ultra English, fragments, zero dash punctuation. EVERY Agent() subagent prompt MUST start with literal tag [CAVEMAN WENYAN-ULTRA]. Subagent thinking and reply = wenyan-ultra; final report = terse English fragments under hard word cap. Exceptions: code, commits, PR bodies, security warnings stay normal prose. Override only on stop caveman or normal mode.\" node \"$HOME/.claude/hooks/emit-nudge.js\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Read",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.wolf/hooks/pre-read.js\"",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/bash-safety.js\"",
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/commit-guard.js\"",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit|MultiEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.wolf/hooks/pre-write.js\"",
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/secrets-scanner.js\"",
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/decision-citation-check.js\"",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Agent",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "HOOK_NUDGE_MESSAGE=\"Subagent dispatch check: prompt must start with literal tag [CAVEMAN WENYAN-ULTRA]. Pick explicit library subagent_type per Agent Selection Policy, never omit type.\" node \"$HOME/.claude/hooks/emit-nudge.js\"",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Read",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.wolf/hooks/post-read.js\"",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit|MultiEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.wolf/hooks/post-write.js\"",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.wolf/hooks/stop.js\"",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}